Name: New ACTHCS Quarto Document
Description: Create a branded Quarto analysis document in the current project or folder, and open it.
Binding: addin_new_epi_document
Interactive: true

Name: Open DSR Calculator
Description: Open the DSR Calculator in the web browser, in a background process, to calculate age-standardised rates from EpiServer.
Binding: episerver_dsr
Interactive: true

Name: Open Dataset Browser
Description: Open the Dataset Browser in the web browser, in a background process, to find EpiServer's tables and views and read their columns and labels.
Binding: episerver_browse
Interactive: true
